<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51007" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vīnum</span></b> , i, n.
		(in vulg. lang. also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vīnus</span></b> , i, m.,
				<i><span class="en">Petr. 41, 12</span></i>; cf. Schol. Bern. ad
			<i><span class="en">Verg. G. 2,
			98</span></i>) [cf. Gr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶνος</span>], <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>wine.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 14, 6,
				8, § 59</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cato, R. R. 156,
				6</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cic. Sen. 18, 65</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Off.
				3, 23, 91</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Brut. 83, 287</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Hor. C. 1,
				4, 18</span></i>; <i><span class="en">2, 3, 13</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Verg. A. 2,
				265</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vini minister,</span>”
				<i>butler</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep. 47, 7</span></i>
			.—<i>Plur.</i>: vina, <i>wine</i>, in gen., <i><span class="en">Plin. 14, 2, 4, § 35</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Lucr.
				2, 391</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Verg. E. 5, 71</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Hor. C. 1,
				11, 6</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 8, 274</span></i>; also, esp., <i>sorts of wine</i>, <i>wines</i>,
			Cato, 
			 R. R. 147 sq.; <i><span class="en">Cic. Tusc.
				5, 5, 13</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 13, 4, 6, § 27</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Hor.
				S. 2, 8, 38</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vina tot consulum regionumque,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep. 114, 25</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>Grapes</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vinum pendens,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cato, R. R. 147</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vinum priusque coctum est pendet putidum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Trin. 2, 4, 125</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vinum legere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. L. L. 5, § 94</span></i>
			 Müll.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>The vine</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">locus vino optimus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cato, R. R. 6, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">serere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib.</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 1, 25</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 14, 4,
				5, § 46</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>C.</b>
			<i>Wine made of fruits</i>, <i>fruit-wine</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 13, 4, 9, § 40</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">14, 16, 19, §
				103</span></i>; <i><span class="en">23, 1, 26,
				§ 52</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Pall. Febr. 25,
			11</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Mart. 10, 10</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
